{"src":"sahih-hadith-text","frame":{"years":23,"makkah":13,"madinah":10,"hadith":3902,"text":"Narrated Ibn `Abbas:Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) started receiving the Divine Inspiration at the age of forty. Then he stayed in Mecca for thirteen years, receiving the Divine Revelation. Then he was ordered to migrate and he lived as an Emigrant for ten years and then died at the age of sixty-three (years)","ur":"ہم سے مطر بن فضل نے بیان کیا، کہا ہم سے روح نے بیان کیا، ان سے ہشام نے بیان کیا، ان سے عکرمہ نے بیان کیا اور ان سے عبداللہ بن عباس رضی اللہ عنہما نے بیان کیا کہ نبی کریم صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم کو چالیس سال کی عمر میں رسول بنایا گیا تھا۔ پھر آپ صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم پر مکہ مکرمہ میں تیرہ سال تک وحی آتی رہی اس کے بعد آپ کو ہجرت کا حکم ہوا اور آپ نے ہجرت کی حالت میں دس سال گزارے۔ ( مدینہ میں ) جب آپ کی وفات ہوئی تو آپ کی عمر تریسٹھ سال کی تھی۔","url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:3902"},"anchors":[{"id":"revelation","year":0,"hadith":3902,"how":"Start of revelation, at the age of forty (Bukhari 3902).","url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:3902"},{"id":"khadija","year":10,"hadith":3896,"how":"Khadija died three years before the migration (Bukhari 3896): 13 − 3 = year 10.","url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:3896"},{"id":"hijrah","year":13,"hadith":3902,"how":"He stayed in Makkah thirteen years, then was ordered to migrate (Bukhari 3902).","url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:3902"},{"id":"conquest","year":21.5,"hadith":4276,"how":"Left for Makkah eight and a half years after the migration (Bukhari 4276): 13 + 8.5 = year 21.5.","url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:4276"},{"id":"death","year":23,"hadith":3902,"how":"Lived as an emigrant ten years and died at sixty-three (Bukhari 3902): 13 + 10 = year 23.","url":"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:3902"}],"events":[{"id":"revelation","order":1,"name":{"en":"Beginning of revelation in the cave of Hira","ur":"غارِ حرا میں وحی کا آغاز"},"period":"makkah","range":[3,4],"count":2,"first":3,"refs":["74:1","74:2","74:3","74:4","74:5"],"surahs":[74],"year":0},{"i